(50, 6, 'Angus Taylor has no plan to fix Australia’s budget, economy', 'We deserve a genuine alternative, but what the opposition leader is serving up is simply a promise to manage the Leviathan a little more politely.', 'The opposition leader’s address to The Sydney Institute last week, and the commentary that followed, were revealing. Across the political spectrum, politics has stopped being about lifting living standards and has become simply about winning and keep... [475 chars]', 'Australian Financial Review', 'https://www.afr.com/policy/economy/angus-taylor-has-no-plan-to-turn-around-australia-s-economic-funk-20260714-p60f5m', 'https://static.ffx.io/images/$zoom_1.0342%2C$multiply_1%2C$ratio_1.777778%2C$width_1059%2C$x_0%2C$y_14/t_crop_custom/c_scale%2Cw_800%2Cq_88%2Cf_jpg/t_afr_opinion_no_age_social_wm/aea535f5da3a8afc6d562d903161ac61ce2f7c0453585abe6228c784ecf1bddf', 'supply-chain', 'neutral', 0, 0, 0.0000, '2026-07-15 22:58:40', '2026-07-19 13:36:24', '2026-07-19 13:36:24'),
(51, 2, 'China building massive naval ship that could displace US rival as world\'s biggest? Here\'s what we know so far', 'China is building a new naval replenishment ship which could be the world\'s largest. Satellite images suggest this vessel is larger than existing Chinese Type 901 support ships. This development enhances the People\'s Liberation Army Navy\'s long-range deployment capabilities significantly. The new ship may surpass the US Navy\'s largest logistics vessels in size. This construction reflects China\'s expanding blue-water navy ambitions and support network.', 'Synopsis\nChina is building a new naval replenishment ship which could be the world\'s largest. Satellite images suggest this vessel is larger than existing Chinese Type 901 support ships. This development enhances the People\'s Liberation Army Navy\'s l... [4246 chars]', 'The Economic Times', 'https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/defence/china-building-massive-naval-ship-that-could-displace-us-rival-as-worlds-biggest-heres-what-we-know-so-far/articleshow/132491073.cms', 'https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-132491334,width-1200,height-630,imgsize-227993,overlay-etdefence/articleshow.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 8, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-19 07:31:00', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-19 13:36:38'),
(52, 2, 'World Uyghur Congress slams Netherlands for ignoring China\'s forced labour, genocide', 'The World Uyghur Congress (WUC) condemned the Dutch government for failing to raise Uyghur forced labour and alleged genocide during its recent China trade mission. Highlighting systematic Chinese repression at UN and international forums, WUC demanded strict enforcement of EU laws to block forced-labour goods from global markets.', 'Munich [Germany], July 19 (ANI): The World Uyghur Congress (WUC) has released its Weekly Brief for July 17, highlighting recent developments concerning Uyghur human rights advocacy, international engagement, and efforts to address ongoing human right... [2971 chars]', 'The Tribune', 'https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/world/world-uyghur-congress-slams-netherlands-for-ignoring-chinas-forced-labour-genocide/', 'https://www.tribuneindia.com/sortd-service/imaginary/v22-01/jpg/large/high?url=dGhldHJpYnVuZS1zb3J0ZC1wcm8tcHJvZC1zb3J0ZC9tZWRpYTY0NTkwODgwLTgzNDMtMTFmMS04YWQ1LTVkY2Y0NzZmMmZlMC5qcGc=', 'supply-chain', 'neutral', 0, 0, 0.0000, '2026-07-19 07:28:01', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-19 13:36:38'),
(53, 2, 'India\'s textile sector enters multi-year structural upcycle on China+1: 360 One Capital', 'The report noted that India\'s share of global apparel trade has remained around 3%, compared with a rise in Bangladesh\'s share to around 9-10% and Vietnam\'s to around 6-7 per cent over the past two decades', 'India\'s textile sector is entering a multi-year structural upcycle, supported by China+1 sourcing, global supply-chain diversification and improving market access through trade agreements, but converting this opportunity into sustained export and mar... [3005 chars]', 'The Hindu Business Line', 'https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/economy/indias-textile-sector-enters-multi-year-structural-upcycle-on-china1-360-one-capital/article71240843.ece', 'https://bl-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/i4jwfe/article71226187.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/10745_15_7_2026_11_28_3_2_IMG_20260715_WA0025.JPG', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 4, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-19 07:05:53', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-20 05:17:56'),
(54, 2, 'India textile exports face execution test despite China+1 tailwinds', 'India\'s textile sector is well placed to benefit from China+1 sourcing and new trade agreements, but long-term export gains will hinge on improving manufacturing scale, productivity and execution, according to 360 One Capital.', 'Synopsis\nIndia\'s textile sector is well placed to benefit from China+1 sourcing and new trade agreements, but long-term export gains will hinge on improving manufacturing scale, productivity and execution, according to 360 One Capital.\nNew Delhi: Ind... [3864 chars]', 'The Economic Times', 'https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/cons-products/garments-/-textiles/india-textile-exports-face-execution-test-despite-china1-tailwinds/articleshow/132490484.cms', 'https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-132490500,width-1200,height-630,imgsize-162428,overlay-economictimes/articleshow.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 9, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-19 05:49:00', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-20 05:17:56'),
(55, 2, 'year structural upcycle on China+1, FTAs; execution, productivity key to unlocking market', 'India\'s textile sector is entering a multi-year structural upcycle, supported by China+1 sourcing, global supply-chain diversification and improving market access through trade agreements, but converting this opportunity into sustained export and market-share gains will depend on execution, productivity and manufacturing competitiveness, according to a research report by 360 One Capital.', 'New Delhi [India], July 19 (ANI): India\'s textile sector is entering a multi-year structural upcycle, supported by China+1 sourcing, global supply-chain diversification and improving market access through trade agreements, but converting this opportu... [3192 chars]', 'The Tribune', 'https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/business/indias-textile-sector-enters-multi-year-structural-upcycle-on-china1-ftas-execution-productivity-key-to-unlocking-market-share-gains/', 'https://www.tribuneindia.com/sortd-service/imaginary/v22-01/jpg/large/high?url=dGhldHJpYnVuZS1zb3J0ZC1wcm8tcHJvZC1zb3J0ZC9tZWRpYWE3MzhiMTcwLTgzMzItMTFmMS04YWQ1LTVkY2Y0NzZmMmZlMC5qcGc=', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 8, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-19 05:28:13', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-20 05:17:56'),
(56, 2, 'Charting the Global Economy: US CPI cools, China growth slows', 'US inflation data eased in June, prompting investors to lower interest rate hike bets. China\'s economy slowed more than anticipated, increasing pressure for government spending while UK consumer-facing services grew in May, driven by retail sales and recreation sectors.', 'Synopsis\nUS inflation data eased in June, prompting investors to lower interest rate hike bets. China\'s economy slowed more than anticipated, increasing pressure for government spending while UK consumer-facing services grew in May, driven by retail ... [3929 chars]', 'The Economic Times', 'https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/small-biz/trade/exports/insights/charting-the-global-economy-us-cpi-cools-china-growth-slows/articleshow/132490075.cms', 'https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-132490070,width-1200,height-630,imgsize-582938,overlay-etrise/articleshow.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'neutral', 5, 4, 0.1111, '2026-07-19 05:11:00', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-19 13:36:38'),
(57, 2, 'China found a $125 billion escape valve for an economy running out of momentum', 'China’s exports are thriving, but households, developers, and private firms remain cautious, leaving the economy dependent on foreign demand.', 'China’s June trade numbers and second-quarter growth numbers looked strong if you look at them one at a time. However, when you put them together, they describe an economy with a very specific problem: factories are still finding buyers abroad, espec... [8912 chars]', 'CryptoSlate', 'https://cryptoslate.com/china-posted-a-125-6-billion-trade-surplus-but-its-economy-may-still-be-slowing/', 'https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/china-trade-surplus-gdp-retail-investment-data.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 5, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-18 15:05:27', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-19 13:36:38'),
(58, 2, 'Vikram-1 reaches orbit: Skyroot’s ‘Mission Aagaman’ boosts India’s $44 billion space push', 'Vikram-1 launch also comes against the backdrop of India’s push to grow its share of the global space economy to $44 billion by 2033, up from about $8 billion now, as the govt looks to private companies to compete in the global small-satellite market dominated by players in the US, Europe and China.', 'The rocket’s three solid-fuel stages performed as planned, beginning with Kalam-1200, which carried Vikram-1 through the densest part of the atmosphere before separating cleanly. The payload fairing then separated, exposing the payloads to space. Nex... [4011 chars]', 'The Financial Express', 'https://www.financialexpress.com/india-news/vikram-1-reaches-orbit-skyroot-aerospace-mission-aagaman-launch-boosts-india-push-toward-dollar-44-billion-space-economy-by-2033/4295522/', 'https://images.financialexpressdigital.com/2026/07/aagaman.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'neutral', 0, 0, 0.0000, '2026-07-18 11:11:17', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-19 13:36:38'),
(59, 2, 'China’s megaprojects transformed Ivory Coast. Now it’s own role is changing', 'Beijing is transitioning from contractor to stakeholder in the fast-growing African economy, with US$209 million tourist complex in the mix.', 'In Abidjan, the commercial capital and economic engine of Ivory Coast, the extent of Chinese infrastructure development is a permanent feature of the transport and trade networks.\nThis includes the Alassane Ouattara Bridge, commonly known as the Coco... [707 chars]', 'South China Morning Post', 'https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3360899/chinas-megaprojects-transformed-ivory-coast-now-its-own-role-changing', 'https://cdn.i-scmp.com/sites/default/files/styles/og_image_scmp_generic/public/d8/images/canvas/2026/07/17/c682f1b3-29e0-4668-abe0-00c99b1dd772_bbf01d93.jpg?itok=YMxfi6fj&v=1784267022', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 2, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-18 10:00:07', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-19 13:36:38'),
(60, 5, 'Can Germany\'s ambitious reform package revive its economy?', 'Germany\'s economy was once the envy of the world; now it\'s languishing due to competition from China and energy costs. Will its reform package deliver results?', 'Germany\'s fragile coalition government has announced a major package of economic reforms aimed at kick-starting the country\'s chronic low growth. The long-awaited measures, announced earlier this month by chancellor Friedrich Merz, include tax cuts, ... [5643 chars]', 'Money Week', 'https://moneyweek.com/economy/eu-economy/can-germanys-ambitious-reform-package-revive-its-economy', 'https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/PVZs2Rc6PAecoBayYJj7B4-2351-80.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 2, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-18 06:00:00', '2026-07-19 13:36:38', '2026-07-19 13:36:47'),
(61, 5, 'Germany and France Strengthen Defense Ties Amidst China\'s Economic Pressure', 'Germany and France pledged to enhance defense cooperation in response to economic competition from China. The leaders discussed missile defense, nuclear deterrence collaborations, and industrial capacity. They aim to address China\'s trade practices impacting European jobs, emphasizing the need for dialogue rather than trade conflict.', 'Germany and France have announced a commitment to bolstering their defense cooperation in response to rising economic competition from China. In a joint press conference, German Chancellor Friedrich Merz and French President Emmanuel Macron stressed ... [705 chars]', 'Devdiscourse', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/article/politics/3952081-germany-and-france-strengthen-defense-ties-amidst-chinas-economic-pressure', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/img?imageUrl=https://devdiscourse.blob.core.windows.net/aiimagegallery/05_05_2026_18_16_26_4740862.png&width=920&format=jpeg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 6, 3, 0.4118, '2026-07-17 16:40:26', '2026-07-19 13:36:47', '2026-07-19 13:36:47'),
(62, 5, 'BlackRock tops $15tn: Where does the world\'s largest asset manager put it all?', 'BlackRock has become the first asset manager to oversee more than $15 trillion (€13tn), nearly three times the nominal annual output of Germany, the EU’s largest economy. Here is how the money is spread.', 'No asset manager had ever crossed the $15 trillion (€13tn) threshold before BlackRock confirmed the milestone in results published on Wednesday.\nThe rise was driven by market gains and new client money.\nClients handed the New York-based giant a net $... [4401 chars]', 'Euronews', 'https://www.euronews.com/business/2026/07/17/blackrock-tops-15tn-where-does-the-worlds-largest-asset-manager-put-it-all', 'https://images.euronews.com/articles/stories/09/84/14/63/1200x675_cmsv2_ada1aa86-625c-50f3-ac7f-678db575e6fe-9841463.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 3, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-17 14:11:18', '2026-07-19 13:36:47', '2026-07-19 13:36:47'),
(63, 5, 'Europe in Flames: Wildfires and Heatwaves Cause Havoc Across the Continent', 'Reeling from intense heatwaves and climate change, Europe faces widespread wildfires and significant distress. Notably, Spain battles massive fires forcing the evacuation of 1,000 people. Additionally, severe heat in France threatens energy supplies, and Germany contends with shipping disruption due to river conditions. Extratropical storms exacerbate the situation, causing fatalities.', 'In northeastern Spain, a vast wildfire expands to cover an area equivalent to San Francisco, forcing mass evacuations amid extreme heatwaves. The devastating heat, linked to human-driven climate change, continues to grip Europe, with temperatures set... [712 chars]', 'Devdiscourse', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/article/science-environment/3951942-europe-in-flames-wildfires-and-heatwaves-cause-havoc-across-the-continent', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/img?imageUrl=https://devdiscourse.blob.core.windows.net/aiimagegallery/09_04_2025_20_58_55_2834503.png&width=920&format=jpeg', 'supply-chain', 'negative', 0, 5, -1.0000, '2026-07-17 12:42:07', '2026-07-19 13:36:47', '2026-07-19 13:36:47'),
(64, 5, 'Fiery Blazes Across Europe: A Heatwave\'s Lethal Impact', 'Europe is grappling with severe wildfires exacerbated by unprecedented summer heatwaves. In Spain, a vast wildfire forced the displacement of over 1,000 people, while in France, drought and storms posed significant challenges. Germany also faced difficulties with shipping disruptions on the Rhine River due to low water levels.', 'Across northeastern Spain, relentless wildfires have torn through vast landscapes, intensified by scorching heatwaves that have left vegetation dangerously dry. Firefighters, assisted by a fleet of 30 aircraft, are battling against a blaze that has r... [858 chars]', 'Devdiscourse', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/article/science-environment/3951877-fiery-blazes-across-europe-a-heatwaves-lethal-impact', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/img?imageUrl=https://devdiscourse.blob.core.windows.net/aiimagegallery/04_05_2026_18_50_28_1901849.png&width=920&format=jpeg', 'supply-chain', 'negative', 0, 5, -1.0000, '2026-07-17 11:00:31', '2026-07-19 13:36:47', '2026-07-19 13:36:47'),
(65, 5, 'Thailand to Host Inaugural \'ADPR EXPO 2027\' in Partnership with INTERSCHUTZ', 'BANGKOK, THAILAND – As environmental, urban, and technological risks continue to intensify, the demand for advanced disaster prevention and mitigation solutions has never been more urgent. In response, Deutsche Messe AG, the world-renowned trade fair organizer from Germany, through Hannover Fairs Asia Pacific, has entered a milestone joint venture with IMPACT Exhibition Management Co., Ltd. to officially launch the ASEAN Disaster Prevention & Recovery Expo (ADPR Expo 2027) powered by INTERSCHUTZ. The premier event is scheduled to take place from 12 – 14 May 2027 at the IMPACT Exhibition and Convention Centre, Bangkok, Thailand.', 'BANGKOK, THAILAND – As environmental, urban, and technological risks continue to intensify, the demand for advanced disaster prevention and mitigation solutions has never been more urgent. In response, Deutsche Messe AG, the world-renowned trade fair... [3092 chars]', 'Bangkok Post', 'https://www.bangkokpost.com/thailand/pr/3286917/thailand-to-host-inaugural-adpr-expo-2027-in-partnership-with-interschutz', 'https://static.bangkokpost.com/media/content/20260716/c1_3286917_700.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'negative', 9, 12, -0.1707, '2026-07-16 11:17:00', '2026-07-19 13:36:47', '2026-07-19 13:36:47'),
(66, 5, 'Hero MotoCorp enters Germany with KSR Group distribution partnership', 'Hero MotoCorp has officially entered the German market through a new distribution partnership. This expansion marks a significant milestone for the company in Europe\'s largest economy. The company will introduce its Euro 5+ compliant products, led by the XPulse 200 4V series. KSR Group will manage sales and service through over twenty-eight outlets across major German cities. This move makes Germany Hero MotoCorp\'s fifth European and fifty-third global market.', 'Synopsis\nHero MotoCorp has officially entered the German market through a new distribution partnership. This expansion marks a significant milestone for the company in Europe\'s largest economy. The company will introduce its Euro 5+ compliant product... [2603 chars]', 'The Economic Times', 'https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/auto/two-wheelers-three-wheelers/hero-motocorp-expands-in-germany-new-ksr-group-partnership-to-launch-euro-5-compliant-motorcycles/articleshow/132437527.cms', 'https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-132437558,width-1200,height-630,imgsize-59660,overlay-economictimes/articleshow.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 9, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-16 11:15:00', '2026-07-19 13:36:47', '2026-07-19 13:36:47'),
(67, 5, 'EU Court Adviser Challenges Austria\'s Brenner Pass Traffic Limits', 'Austria\'s restrictions on heavy-duty traffic along the Brenner motorway, a critical trans-Alpine route connecting Germany and Italy, have been deemed inconsistent with EU regulations, as per the European Court of Justice\'s chief advisor. This decision could have significant implications for cross-border trade within the bloc.', 'Austria\'s restrictions on heavy-duty traffic flow along the Brenner motorway, a pivotal route weaving through the Alps between Germany and Italy, face legal scrutiny.\nAccording to the principal legal advisor of the European Court of Justice, these me... [319 chars]', 'Devdiscourse', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/article/business/3951263-eu-court-adviser-challenges-austrias-brenner-pass-traffic-limits', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/img?imageUrl=https://devdiscourse.blob.core.windows.net/aiimagegallery/13_05_2026_00_02_23_6136183.png&width=920&format=jpeg', 'supply-chain', 'negative', 0, 3, -1.0000, '2026-07-16 10:51:23', '2026-07-19 13:36:47', '2026-07-19 13:36:47'),
