(72, 7, 'Murmu embarks on 3-nation Europe tour to deepen ties with Moldova, North Macedonia, Romania', 'New Delhi, Jul 19 (PTI) President Droupadi Murmu on Sunday embarked on state visits to Moldova, North Macedonia, and Romania to deepen India’s ties with the three European countries across a range of sectors, including trade and technology, and to boost people-to-people ties. The first leg of her tour begins with a visit to Moldova […]', 'Murmu will hold delegation-level talks with Moldovan President Maia Sandu and meet the President of the Parliament, Igor Grosu. She is also scheduled to interact with members of the Moldova-India Parliamentary Friendship Group, address a Business For... [2772 chars]', 'ThePrint', 'https://theprint.in/india/murmu-embarks-on-3-nation-europe-tour-to-deepen-ties-with-moldova-north-macedonia-romania/2990406/', 'https://staticprintenglish.theprint.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/theprint_default_image_new.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 2, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-19 07:16:30', '2026-07-19 13:36:55', '2026-07-19 13:36:55'),
