(84, 1, 'Das Kadam, Das Ka Dam: Strengthening India\'s Indo-Pacific Ties', 'BJP MP Sambit Patra lauds PM Modi\'s strategic visits to Indonesia, Australia, New Zealand, and Seychelles, emphasizing enhanced partnerships in defense, economy, and culture. These initiatives fortify India\'s position across the Indo-Pacific and Indian Ocean regions, aligning with nations like Japan and Australia to advance national interests.', 'On Sunday, Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) MP Sambit Patra spotlighted the significant outcomes of Prime Minister Narendra Modi\'s recent diplomatic visits to Indonesia, Australia, and New Zealand, as well as his prior visit to Seychelles. The initiative... [930 chars]', 'Devdiscourse', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/article/headlines/3949036-das-kadam-das-ka-dam-strengthening-indias-indo-pacific-ties', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/img?imageUrl=https://devdiscourse.blob.core.windows.net/devnews/12_07_2026_13_48_05_4232527.jpg&width=920&format=jpeg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 3, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-12 08:18:10', '2026-07-19 13:37:02', '2026-07-19 13:37:02'),
