(91, 3, 'Why Ranveer Singh\'s Dhurandhar Flopped in Japan Despite Rs 3100 Crore Global Success? Experts Weigh In - EXCLUSIVE', 'Ranveer Singh\'s Dhurandhar has rewritten box office records worldwide, becoming one of the biggest Indian blockbusters in recent years. However, its theatrical run in Japan has failed to mirror that global success, raising questions about why the film struggled in a market that has embraced several Indian titles in the past. To understand the reasons behind the film\'s disappointing performance in Japan, Zoom spoke exclusively with trade analyst Taran Adarsh and producer and film business expert Girish Johar, who offered their insights on the issue., Bollywood, Times Now', 'Ranveer Singh\'s Dhurandhar has rewritten box office records worldwide, becoming one of the biggest Indian blockbusters in recent years. However, its theatrical run in Japan has failed to mirror that global success, raising questions about why the fil... [4063 chars]', 'Times Now', 'https://www.timesnownews.com/entertainment-news/bollywood/why-ranveer-singh-dhurandhar-flopped-in-japan-despite-rs-3100-crore-global-success-experts-weigh-in-exclusive-article-155116002', 'https://images.timesnownews.com/thumb/msid-155115977,thumbsize-40908,width-1280,height-720,resizemode-75/155115977.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 6, 4, 0.2000, '2026-07-17 09:53:11', '2026-07-19 13:37:10', '2026-07-19 13:37:10'),
