(123, 9, 'Malaysia eyes land route for durian exports to China', 'Malaysia is exploring an overland export route for fresh durians to China to address a domestic supply glut and reduce logistics costs. Read more at straitstimes.com.', 'KUALA LUMPUR – Malaysia is exploring a new overland export route for fresh durians to China to ease a domestic supply glut by lowering logistics costs and reaching consumers beyond China’s wealthy coastal cities.\nThe effort reflects mounting pressure... [5951 chars]', 'The Straits Times', 'https://www.straitstimes.com/asia/se-asia/malaysia-eyes-china-land-route-for-durians-as-supply-glut-deepens', 'https://cassette.sphdigital.com.sg/image/straitstimes/078c58c7285e84da0b183c97aaeffab1a1b6a04bafe5bee8fff13964ed1daaf9', 'supply-chain', 'neutral', 0, 0, 0.0000, '2026-07-15 21:00:00', '2026-07-20 05:18:29', '2026-07-20 05:18:29'),
