(126, 8, 'Indian mango festival inaugurated in Singapore', '​The Indian High Commission in Singapore has organised a three-day event to promote premium mangoes, aimed at boosting agricultural trade ties and expanding the country\'s horticultural market footprint in the city-state. High Commissioner Shilpak Ambule on Friday welcomed the return of the Indian Mango Festival at the Suntec Convention Centre in Singapore.', 'Synopsis\n​The Indian High Commission in Singapore has organised a three-day event to promote premium mangoes, aimed at boosting agricultural trade ties and expanding the country\'s horticultural market footprint in the city-state. High Commissioner Sh... [2600 chars]', 'The Economic Times', 'https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/nri/latest-updates/indian-mango-festival-inaugurated-in-singapore/articleshow/132474567.cms', 'https://img.etimg.com/thumb/width-1200,height-900,imgsize-172965,resizemode-75,msid-132474567/nri/latest-updates/indian-mango-festival-inaugurated-in-singapore.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 3, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-18 05:42:53', '2026-07-20 05:20:46', '2026-07-20 05:20:46'),
(127, 8, '\"We want more !\": Singaporean envoy to India Simon Wong welcomes 1st shipment of J&K cherries, plums', 'Singapore High Commissioner to India Simon Wong on Friday welcomed the arrival of the first shipment of cherries and plums from Jammu and Kashmir to Singapore, hailing the expansion of agricultural trade between the two countries and expressing hope for such exports.', 'New Delhi [India], July 17 (ANI): Singapore High Commissioner to India Simon Wong on Friday welcomed the arrival of the first shipment of cherries and plums from Jammu and Kashmir to Singapore, hailing the expansion of agricultural trade between the ... [2915 chars]', 'The Tribune', 'https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/world/we-want-more-singaporean-envoy-to-india-simon-wong-welcomes-1st-shipment-of-jk-cherries-plums/', 'https://www.tribuneindia.com/sortd-service/imaginary/v22-01/jpg/large/high?url=dGhldHJpYnVuZS1zb3J0ZC1wcm8tcHJvZC1zb3J0ZC9tZWRpYTJiZmE1NGEwLTgxYWMtMTFmMS04YWQ1LTVkY2Y0NzZmMmZlMC5qcGc=', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 4, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-17 06:53:01', '2026-07-20 05:20:46', '2026-07-20 05:20:46'),
(128, 8, 'Lead\'s Warehouse Waltz: The Singapore Shuffle', 'Lead stocks at the London Metal Exchange surged due to warehouse activity in Singapore, indicating changes in global trade patterns. Indian brands dominate on-warrant inventory, with China emerging as a new export destination, impacting Singapore\'s lead stocks. The lead market shows signs of arbitrage-driven activity and warehousing strategies.', 'The London Metal Exchange (LME) witnessed a significant 58% increase in lead stocks, largely due to warranting activities at Singapore warehouses. A total of 171,175 metric tons were added in just two days, marking a notable rise in the battery metal... [575 chars]', 'Devdiscourse', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/article/business/3951679-leads-warehouse-waltz-the-singapore-shuffle', 'https://www.devdiscourse.com/img?imageUrl=https://devdiscourse.blob.core.windows.net/aiimagegallery/07_05_2026_16_49_48_9287191.png&width=920&format=jpeg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 3, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-17 05:01:04', '2026-07-20 05:20:46', '2026-07-20 05:20:46'),
(129, 8, 'How Iran war, tariffs are reshaping global sea trade and affecting Singapore', 'Geopolitical disruptions, including the Iran war, have redrawn shipping routes, and this could lead to more ships calling in Singapore in the future. Read more at straitstimes.com.', 'More ships to call at S’pore? How the Iran war, tariffs are reshaping global sea trade\nScroll down\nFrequent visitors to Singapore’s East Coast Park may have noticed a busier coastline in recent months, with ships anchored offshore waiting to refuel o... [9387 chars]', 'The Straits Times', 'https://www.straitstimes.com/business/companies-markets/more-ships-to-call-at-spore-how-the-iran-war-tariffs-are-reshaping-global-sea-trade', 'https://cassette.sphdigital.com.sg/image/straitstimes/c6b77f5ab9821cf6be0df2b318c4060608e865a8b193de0e9d30b64aaa9c7416', 'supply-chain', 'negative', 0, 15, -1.0000, '2026-07-17 05:00:00', '2026-07-20 05:20:46', '2026-07-20 05:20:46'),
