(136, 7, 'The world’s set for a bumpy ride', 'Trump, Xi and Putin’s actions will cause turmoil in world economy going ahead. India will have to take some tough calls on the revenue front', 'So the world is back where it started in the US-Iran war. After a short lived ceasefire, both sides are bombing each other. The flow of crude oil is disrupted and global supply is likely to remain below demand for a long time to come, the IMF thinks.... [4260 chars]', 'The Hindu Business Line', 'https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/opinion/the-worlds-set-for-a-bumpy-ride/article71241850.ece', 'https://bl-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/jxiocm/article71241859.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/2026-07-17T084539Z_1381958612_RC2V2MANYULO_RTRMADP_3_IRAN-CRISIS-REACTIONS.JPG', 'supply-chain', 'negative', 1, 6, -0.6923, '2026-07-20 00:30:00', '2026-07-20 05:30:29', '2026-07-20 05:30:29'),
(137, 7, 'FIFA World Cup 2026 final fever drives record sales, packed bars and late-night rush across India', 'As football fever grips the nation, sportswear and snack sales soar to new heights. Anticipating a wave of fans for the final match, many bars and restaurants extend their hours into the night. Business owners report record-breaking demands for football gear and themed meals, showcasing the sport\'s rising influence on culture and economy across the country.', 'Synopsis\nAs football fever grips the nation, sportswear and snack sales soar to new heights. Anticipating a wave of fans for the final match, many bars and restaurants extend their hours into the night. Business owners report record-breaking demands ... [5952 chars]', 'The Economic Times', 'https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/india/fifa-world-cup-2026-final-fever-drives-record-sales-packed-bars-and-late-night-rush-across-india/articleshow/132500881.cms', 'https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-132500961,width-1200,height-630,imgsize-362020,overlay-economictimes/articleshow.jpg', 'supply-chain', 'positive', 5, 0, 1.0000, '2026-07-20 00:30:00', '2026-07-20 05:30:29', '2026-07-20 05:30:29'),
